# MCP Notes

This repository may use Model Context Protocol servers to expose local or remote
tools to AI coding agents.

## Policy

- Keep secrets out of the repository.
- Use environment variables or documented user-level secret files.
- Prefer read-only access for shared or remote environments.
- Add guardrails for destructive tools.
- Document prerequisites and health checks.
- Ask before adding or changing MCP servers.

